# AI Chat Configuration
# This file shows the environment variables needed for Gemini AI integration

# Google Gemini API Key
# Get a free API key from: https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey
# Steps:
# 1. Visit https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey
# 2. Click "Create API Key"
# 3. Copy the generated key
# 4. Add it to your .env.local file as shown below (without # prefix)

# VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSyCWUXGa0OyCKkid3F2rnPCAkJ6HY4VAqY4

# Note: The VITE_ prefix is required for Vite to expose variables to the client
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your actual API key
